WEBVTT

00:06:56.286 --> 00:07:00.390
many of them born
in the late 1990s and afterwards,

00:07:00.414 --> 00:07:03.318
didn't even know
that the phrase "the N-word"

00:07:03.342 --> 00:07:06.315
is a relatively new invention
in American English.

00:07:06.339 --> 00:07:08.939
When I was growing up, it didn't exist.

00:07:10.339 --> 00:07:14.172
But in the late 1980s,

00:07:14.196 --> 00:07:18.069
black college students,
writers, intellectuals,

00:07:18.093 --> 00:07:23.458
more and more started to talk about
racist attacks against them.

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:28.212
But increasingly,
when they told these stories,

00:07:28.236 --> 00:07:30.721
they stopped using the word.